WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,360
Big brother, I have to trouble you to move to the truck.

2
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:03,600
OK no problem

3
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:16,340
I was dumbfounded and moved them all up for him.

4
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:17,940
Brother, you are so awesome

5
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,420
Come on, here's five hundred dollars

6
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:20,620
Didn't I say four hundred?

7
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:23,180
In fact, the market price is only five hundred yuan. You can move it so well.

8
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:24,340
We can't treat you badly

9
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:26,060
That won't work. If you say four hundred, then four hundred.

10
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:28,180
A manly man can make a fool of himself

11
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:29,260
How can the price be raised midway?

12
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:31,340
This is not something a man would do. I'll give you the hundred.

13
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:34,600
Look at people

14
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:36,840
There are not many people like this anymore.

15
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:39,200
Why does it feel like you are talking about me?

16
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:41,920
You can buy 200 kilograms of rice here for 400 yuan.

17
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:43,200
Is it so easy to make money?

18
00:00:43,970 --> 00:00:46,170
Let's go and have a look at the labor market.

19
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:50,340
It's over. I don't know the road.

20
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:52,420
I don't know where the labor market is

21
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:53,420
Where can I find this?

22
00:00:54,150 --> 00:00:56,710
Old man, where is the labor market and how to get there?

23
00:00:56,710 --> 00:00:59,070
Labor market? Take the bus?
